{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Keep ON_CHANGE exports off checkpoint processing**\n\n`onOperationChange` runs synchronously while checkpoint coordination is still active. This call performs S3/CloudWatch I/O and `flush()` inline for every change, so a slow exporter stalls subsequent checkpoints and can cause invocation timeouts. Queue immutable snapshots here and drain/flush them asynchronously, awaiting completion from `onInvocationEnd`; add a delayed-exporter test proving this hook returns promptly.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7nh9WK","finding_digest":"bc70e659378e613de7bdb3b2633e5192cc833438fddfe77f4a591b9e4288a471","finding_id":"arf_v1_xryomwjxrzqt3z55wozggpsrsl","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.emit::checkpoint-hook-blocking","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.emit::checkpoint-hook-blocking","line":128,"observation_digest":"a6162069bdd1724241c8c985f0591814ebd68f757729186949fca243029d1c19","observation_id":"aro_v1_uylca2n52fzeeqoizgc7awiyct","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/WorkflowInsight.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_xryomwjxrzqt3z55wozggpsrsl","published_at":"2026-08-28T22:27:00Z","review_id":"arr_v1_5xididmhluq4mhdhugntjpm257","reviewed_base_sha":"6501c39f553655583e33238eb1d821e4f44b8e26","reviewed_head_sha":"bdbd88fcdf777f50567d968c0e73fa11c8eb39ad","reviewer":"codex","start_line":128,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_zqqftks5rrwckdigu2tqyxjzpl","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-08-28T22:27:00Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
